# Generated population caches (Part 8), full-scale sweep outputs, and
# figures -- large, reproducible from the notebook, not committed. Each
# folder's own README.md is the only file tracked in it (so the folder
# itself still shows up, empty, on a fresh clone) -- `dir/*` + `!dir/README.md`
# rather than a bare `dir/`, since git won't re-include a file whose parent
# directory is itself excluded.
data/*
!data/README.md
results/*
!results/README.md
plots/*
!plots/README.md